        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Turn a Talk into a Blog Post\n\nTurns a recorded talk into a written blog post. The agent restructures the content instead of tidying the transcript, so it reads like prose.\n\n**How it works:** \"1 Recording\" takes the video. \"2 Extract audio\" pulls the soundtrack, \"3 Transcribe\" turns speech into English text, and \"4 Agent\" rewrites it as a title, an opening, three headed sections and a close. \"5 Output\" returns the post.\n\n**Try this:** Pick models on \"3 Transcribe\" and \"4 Agent\", then edit the agent's system prompt to ask for five sections."
        },
